Package: linux-image-4.14-355-halium11-l4v3nx-xiaomi-vayu
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Xiaomi Vayu
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Xiaomi Vayu device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-4.14-355-halium11-l4v3nx-xiaomi-vayu package for a bootimage suitable
 for Android boot loaders.

